          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. How many little squares are there in each shape of the sequence of Stacked Squares? Which number sequence does this give? Can you explain why?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.186,
            0.824,
            0.269
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. How many little triangles are there in each shape of the sequence of Stacked Triangles? Which number sequence does this give? Can you explain why? (Hint: In each shape in the sequence, how many triangles are there in each row?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.834,
            0.187,
            0.935,
            0.259
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.834,
